     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Daniel,<div>I am guessing this is the same issue we were seeing over the weekend where <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393656608000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zngQZJlgh0Os5-9WMo71F\">shinyapps.io</a> isn&#39;t giving the correct error message.  Is it at all possible that you are running with R version 3.2.5?  If so, downgrading to 3.2.4 should fix this issue.  The error message should be saying something like: <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792393656608000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zngQZJlgh0Os5-9WMo71F\">shinyapps.io</a> doesn&#39;t support this version of R yet.</div><div><br></div><div>-Tareef</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
